? Many change requests may signal unclear requirements or scope. Understanding the causes allows the PM to address the root problem with the customer.

@@ PE6 | Hybrid
How can the project manager best monitor stakeholder satisfaction during a project with frequent releases?
A) Short surveys and conversations after each release, with follow-up
B) A single, detailed satisfaction survey at the end of the project
C) Counting the number of complaints the sponsor receives each month
D) Assuming stakeholders are satisfied as long as no one complains
= A
? Regular feedback with visible action allows the PM to detect and address dissatisfaction early.

@@ PE6 | Agile
The team's forecast shows that the release will be three weeks later than stakeholders expected. What should the project manager do?
