@@ PE8 | Predictive
A project team has 13 members, including the project manager. How many communication channels are there?
A) 78
B) 156
C) 13
D) 91
= A
? Channels = n(n − 1) / 2 = 13 × 12 / 2 = 78.

@@ PE8 | Hybrid
An issue requires a decision from the sponsor, who has very little time. How should the project manager communicate it?
A) A concise brief stating the issue, its impact, the options and a recommendation
